msgid "*Progress and impact report*"
msgstr "*Fortschritts- und Wirkungsbericht*"

#. type: Title ##
#: _pages/donate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "FAQs Donations"
msgstr "FAQs über Spenden"

#. type: Title ####
#: _pages/donate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "What payment methods can I use to donate?"
msgstr "Welche Zahlungsmethoden kann ich für eine Spenden verwenden?"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/donate.md
msgid "Open Collective, Liberapay, and direct bank transfer."
msgstr "Open Collective, Liberapay und direkte Banküberweisung."

#. type: Title ####
#: _pages/donate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Can I donate just once, or do I have to set up recurring donations?"
msgstr "Kann ich auch nur einmal spenden oder muss ich eine wiederkehrende Spende einrichten?"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/donate.md
msgid "You can donate once, or set up recurring donations. Both are supported."
msgstr "Du kannst einmalig spenden oder wiederkehrende Spenden einrichten. Beides wird unterstützt."

#. type: Title ####
#: _pages/donate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Will I receive updates about how my donation impacts F-Droid?"
msgstr "Erhalte ich Updates darüber, wie sich meine Spende auf F-Droid auswirkt?"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/donate.md
msgid "Yes! You can follow along in our weekly blog posts, in the forum, or in GitLab to track development progress."
msgstr "Ja! Du kannst den Entwicklungsfortschritt in unseren wöchentlichen Blogbeiträgen, im Forum oder in GitLab verfolgen."

#. type: Title ####
#: _pages/donate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Join us in keeping software free and accessible!"
msgstr "Hilf uns dabei, Software frei und zugänglich zu halten!"

#. type: Title ##
#: _pages/donate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Previous Setup"
msgstr "Vorherige Einstellung"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/donate.md
msgid "Donations for F-Droid were previously handled by F-Droid Limited, a UK \"private company\" registered in England (no. [08420676](https://beta.companieshouse.gov.uk/company/08420676)).  It has been out of use since 2021."
msgstr "Spenden für F-Droid wurden bisher von F-Droid Limited, einem britischen, in England (unter der Nr. [08420676](https://beta.companieshouse.gov.uk/company/08420676)) registrierten „Privatunternehmen” abgewickelt. Seit 2021 ist dies nicht mehr der Fall."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: _pages/issues.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Issues"
msgstr "Tickets"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/issues.md
msgid "If you come across an issue regarding F-Droid, please report it to the related issue tracker."
msgstr "Wenn du auf ein Problem im Zusammenhang mit F-Droid stößt, melde es bitte im entsprechenden Ticketsystem."

#. type: Title ###
#: _pages/issues.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Client App"
msgstr "Client-App"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/issues.md
msgid "If you’re having a problem with the F-Droid client application (our app store app), please check if we already know about it, and/or report it in [this issue tracker](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidclient/issues)."
msgstr "Wenn du ein Problem mit dem F-Droid-Client (unserer App für den App-Store) hast, überprüfe, ob der Fehler bereits bekannt ist, und berichte ggf. davon in diesem [Ticketsystem](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidclient/issues)."

#. type: Title ###
#: _pages/issues.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "App Data"
msgstr "App-Daten"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/issues.md
msgid "For problems related to the contents of the F-Droid repository (the apps in our app store), such as a disappeared or outdated applications, please use [this issue tracker](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroiddata/issues)."
msgstr "Bei Problemen im Zusammenhang mit dem Inhalt des F-Droid-Repositorys (die Apps in unserem App-Store), wie z.B. verschwundene oder veraltete Anwendungen, verwende bitte [dieses Ticketsystem](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroiddata/issues)."

#. type: Title ###
#: _pages/issues.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Request for Packaging"
msgstr "Anfrage zur Paketierung (Request for Packaging)"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/issues.md
msgid "To request a new application to be packaged (add an app to our app store), please, first check the app data issue tracker to see if that application was available in the past and got removed. Any remaining request for packaging (RFP) can be added to [this issue tracker](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/rfp/-/issues/)."
msgstr "Um die Paketierung einer neuen Anwendung zu beantragen (Hinzufügen einer Anwendung zu unserem App-Store), überprüfe bitte zunächst das App-Daten-Ticketsystem, um festzustellen, ob diese Anwendung in der Vergangenheit verfügbar war und entfernt wurde. Alle verbleibenden Anfragen zur Paketierung (RFP) können [diesem Ticketsystem](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/rfp/-/issues/) hinzugefügt werden."

#. type: Title ###
#: _pages/issues.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Server Tools"
msgstr "Server-Tools"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/issues.md
msgid "For issues on the server tools (building apps yourself or running your own repo), please use [this issue tracker](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver/issues)."
msgstr "Für die Server-Tools (eigene App-Herstellung oder eigener Repo-Betrieb) verwende bitte dieses [Ticketsystem](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver/issues)."

#. type: Title ###
#: _pages/issues.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Website"
msgstr "Website"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/issues.md
msgid "For issues relating to this web site, you can use [this issue tracker](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroid-website/issues)."
msgstr "Bei Fragen, die sich auf diese Website beziehen, kannst du dieses [Ticketsystem](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroid-website/issues) nutzen."

#. type: Title ###
#: _pages/issues.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Website Search"
msgstr "Website-Suche"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/issues.md
msgid "For issues relating to https://search.f-droid.org or search results in this website, you can use [this issue tracker](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroid-website-search/issues)."
msgstr "Bei Angelegenheiten im Zusammenhang mit https://search.f-droid.org oder Suchergebnissen auf dieser Website kannst du dieses [Ticketsystem](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroid-website-search/issues) verwenden."

#. type: Title ###
#: _pages/issues.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Fire Hose"
msgstr "Die Flutwelle"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/issues.md
msgid "If you have not found the right place, try searching through [all of the issues](https://gitlab.com/groups/fdroid/-/issues/)  tracked by the F-Droid project."
msgstr "Wenn du nicht den passenden Platz gefunden hast, versuche [alle Tickets](https://gitlab.com/groups/fdroid/-/issues/) zu durchsuchen,  die vom F-Droid-Projekt erfasst sind."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: _pages/repomaker.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Repomaker"
msgstr "Repomaker"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/repomaker.md
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "F-Droid.org is just a repo out of hundreds of repos created by individuals all around the globe. With the tools of F-Droid, everyone can create their own repo. So whether you are a musician who wants to publish their music or a developer who wants to serve nightly builds of their app, you are free to create your own repo and share it with other people independently of F-Droid.org."
msgid "The F-Droid app store is essentially a collection of apps created by individuals all around the world. Collections of apps are also called repositories, or repos for short. So whether you are a musician who wants to publish their music or a developer who wants to serve nightly builds of their app, you can create your own repo and share it with other people independently of F-Droid.org."
msgstr "F-Droid.org ist nur eines von Hunderten von Repositorys, die von Einzelpersonen auf der ganzen Welt erstellt wurden. Mit den Tools von F-Droid kann jeder sein eigenes Repository erstellen. Egal, ob Musiker, der seine Musik veröffentlichen möchte, oder Entwickler, der Nightly Builds seiner App bereitstellen möchte – es steht dir frei, dein eigenes Repository zu erzeugen und es unabhängig von F-Droid.org mit anderen zu teilen."

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/repomaker.md
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "In the past, creating a repo has been difficult because you had to have knowledge on the command line, needed to edit text files to edit your packages' store details and had to paste screenshots in a special system of directories to have them served well inside the F-Droid app."
msgid "In the past, creating a repo was difficult because you had to have knowledge of the command line, needed to know how to edit text files to edit your packages' store details and had to paste screenshots in a special system of directories to have them displayed inside the F-Droid app."
msgstr "Früher war es schwierig, ein Repo zu erstellen, da Kommandozeilenkenntnisse nötig waren, man Textdateien bearbeiten musste, um die Details des Pakets zu bearbeiten, und Bildschirmfotos in ein spezielles System von Verzeichnissen einfügen musste, damit sie in der F-Droid-App richtig verarbeitet wurden."

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/repomaker.md
msgid "This process is simplified thanks to Repomaker. Now you can create your own mini app store, using our simplified interface, guiding you through every step in the process."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/repomaker.md
msgid "This all got easier now: with Repomaker, you are able to create your own repo and do not need to have any special knowledge to do so.  Check out the [installation guide](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/repomaker/blob/master/README.md#installation)  for information on how you can install Repomaker on your device."
msgstr "Das ist jetzt alles einfacher geworden: Mit Repomaker kann man sein eigenes Repo erzeugen, ohne dafür Spezialwissen zu brauchen. Informationen, wie du Repomaker auf deinem Gerät installieren kannst, findest du in der [Installationsanleitung](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/repomaker/blob/master/README.md#installation)."

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/repomaker.md
msgid "Try out the demo test instance <https://repomakerdemo.fdroid.net> and tell us what you think."
msgstr ""

